0%27Prop%27%2C%20%27Sort%27%2C%20%27this%27%2C%20%27at%27%2C%20%27using%27%2C%20%27obtain%27%2C%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20Names%20the%20emitted%20code%20relies%20on%2C%20and%20names%20Lean%20derives%20inside%20a%20type%27s%20namespace.%0A%20%20%27Nat%27%2C%20%27Int%27%2C%20%27String%27%2C%20%27Bool%27%2C%20%27Unit%27%2C%20%27IO%27%2C%20%27true%27%2C%20%27false%27%2C%20%27main%27%2C%20%27toString%27%2C%20%27decide%27%2C%20%27panic%27%2C%20%27Float%27%2C%0A%20%20%27rec%27%2C%20%27recOn%27%2C%20%27casesOn%27%2C%20%27noConfusion%27%2C%20%27noConfusionType%27%2C%20%27below%27%2C%20%27brecOn%27%2C%20%27binductionOn%27%2C%20%27ibelow%27%2C%0A%20%20%27ctorIdx%27%2C%20%27toCtorIdx%27%2C%20%27sizeOf_spec%27%2C%20%27injEq%27%2C%20%27inj%27%2C%20%27induct%27%2C%20%27eq_def%27%2C%20%27mk%27%2C%0A%5D%29%3B%0A%0Aconst%20HELPERS%20%3D%20%7B%0A%20%20jsNumber%3A%20%60%2F--%20ECMAScript%20Number%3A%3AtoString%3A%20the%20shortest%20decimal%20that%20reads%20back%20as%20the%0Avalue%2C%20the%20nearer%20one%20and%20then%20the%20even%20one%20on%20a%20tie%2C%20laid%20out%20as%20JavaScript%0Aprints%20it%3B%20exact%20Nat%20arithmetic%20on%20the%20bits.%20-%2F%0Adef%20ml_js_layout%20%28digits%20%3A%20List%20Char%29%20%28n%20%3A%20Int%29%20%3A%20String%20%3A%3D%0A%20%20let%20k%20%3A%20Int%20%3A%3D%20digits.length%0A%20%20let%20text%20%3A%3D%20String.ofList%0A%20%20let%20zeros%20%28count%20%3A%20Int%29%20%3A%3D%20List.replicate%20count.toNat%20%270%27%0A%20%20if%20k%20%E2%89%A4%20n%20%E2%88%A7%20n%20%E2%89%A4%2021%20then%20text%20%28digits%20%2B%2B%20zeros%20%28n%20-%20k%29%29%0A%20%20else%20if%200%20%3C%20n%20%E2%88%A7%20n%20%E2%89%A4%2021%20then%20text%20%28digits.take%20n.toNat%20%2B%2B%20%27.%27%20%3A%3A%20digits.drop%20n.toNat%29%0A%20%20else%20if%20-6%20%3C%20n%20%E2%88%A7%20n%20%E2%89%A4%200%20then%20text%20%28%270%27%20%3A%3A%20%27.%27%20%3A%3A%20zeros%20%28-n%29%20%2B%2B%20digits%29%0A%20%20else%0A%20%20%20%20let%20e%20%3A%3D%20n%20-%201%0A%20%20%20%20let%20exp%20%3A%3D%20%28if%20e%20%3C%200%20th